To fix the `NullPointerException`, we need to ensure that the `affirmations` array is non-null before accessing its elements.

Here is the corrected code:

```java
public class InnerCalm {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        String[] affirmations = {"Breathe.", "Focus.", "Calm."};
        java.util.Random rand = new java.util.Random();
        int index = rand.nextInt(affirmations.length);

        // Ensure the array is not null before accessing it
        if (affirmations != null) {
            System.out.println("Your affirmation: " + affirmations[index]);
        } else {
            System.out.println("Array is null.");
        }
    }
}
```

